    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A third-person horror game where you must solve puzzles, perform tasks, follow rules, and even shoot enemies, all in order to survive on a spaceship filled with unknown horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A puzzle-solving, shooting, chasing, stealth game with a very deep story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a human incubator inside a massive spaceship. Near you is a note that says: you are the last human in the universe. In this story, humanity left Earth because it became uninhabitable and witnessed terrifying events in space. Before dying, the last humans in space left one person in an incubator, hoping that humanity would be reborn on the new Earth. The protagonist's mission is to keep the spaceship operational by performing maintenance tasks. However, they must remain vigilant, as some of the cosmic horrors that annihilated the human race are still hidden within the ship. This futuristic-themed game involves performing maintenance tasks\u2026 and, above all: avoiding what should never have been seen by human eyes.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A third-person horror game where you must solve puzzles, perform tasks, follow rules, and even shoot enemies, all in order to survive on a spaceship filled with unknown horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A puzzle-solving, shooting, chasing, stealth game with a very deep story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a human incubator inside a massive spaceship. Near you is a note that says: you are the last human in the universe. In this story, humanity left Earth because it became uninhabitable and witnessed terrifying events in space. Before dying, the last humans in space left one person in an incubator, hoping that humanity would be reborn on the new Earth. The protagonist's mission is to keep the spaceship operational by performing maintenance tasks. However, they must remain vigilant, as some of the cosmic horrors that annihilated the human race are still hidden within the ship. This futuristic-themed game involves performing maintenance tasks\u2026 and, above all: avoiding what should never have been seen by human eyes.</p>",
    "short_description": "You are the last human that exists, and you wake up trapped in a spaceship full of dangers lurking around you. You must perform maintenance on the ship to keep it functioning until you reach Earth. Once on Earth, will everything start again?",
